flowchart TD
  A["Vas a pedir algo"] --> B{"¿Es un favor grande, incómodo o fuera de lo normal?"}
  B -->|"No"| C{"¿Hay confianza?"}
  C -->|"Sí"| D["Can you… / Could you…?"]
  C -->|"No"| E["Could you… / Would you mind + -ing?"]
  B -->|"Sí"| F{"¿Hay confianza?"}
  F -->|"Sí"| G["I was wondering if you could… / Is there any chance you could…?"]
  F -->|"No: jefe, cliente, desconocido"| H["I was hoping you might… / Would it be at all possible to… / I don't suppose you could…"]

flowchart TD
  A["Algo del pasado"] --> G{"¿Pasó una sola vez o dices cuántas veces?"}
  G -->|"Sí"| H["past simple: I went there three times"]
  G -->|"No, era habitual"| B{"¿Es un estado? (live, have, be, like, know)"}
  B -->|"Sí"| C["used to: I used to live in Temuco"]
  B -->|"No, es una acción repetida"| D{"¿Ya está claro de qué época hablas?"}
  D -->|"Sí"| E["would o used to: Every summer we would go to the beach"]
  D -->|"No"| F["used to para abrir: I used to play the guitar"]

flowchart TD
  A["see / hear / watch / notice / feel + objeto"] --> B{"¿El objeto hace la acción?"}
  B -->|"No, la recibe"| P["participio: I heard my name called"]
  B -->|"Sí"| C{"¿La percibiste entera?"}
  C -->|"Sí, de principio a fin"| D["verbo base: I saw him cross the street"]
  C -->|"No, solo una parte o en curso"| E["-ing: I saw him crossing the street"]
  A --> F{"¿La frase está en pasiva?"}
  F -->|"Sí"| G["to + verbo o -ing: He was seen to leave / leaving"]
